  "hard_rules": [
    "The 734 pairs, train/valid labels, split assignments, safe transfer features, cleaned fields, and five model payloads are regenerated from pinned sources and must replay their frozen hashes.",
    "Every cleaned character from every nonempty field is represented in exactly one shared chunk; no beginning-middle-end sampling or chunk cap is allowed.",
    "Every shared chunk must fit the 480-token budget under all five tokenizers including model prefix and special tokens.",
    "The exact same chunk strings and ordering are encoded by all five models.",
    "Chunk counts, text lengths, tokenizer lengths, and field missingness are audit-only and forbidden from every selectable model.",
    "Raw encoder ranking uses only the preregistered field-equal aggregate without a fitted head.",
    "Fitted pipelines use the same six aggregate definitions for each encoder and are matched against a no-encoder control.",
    "same_market_bool and same_source_dataset_bool remain audit-only and cannot enter selectable candidates.",
    "The shared reranker is excluded because it cannot follow the same seller-block-vector aggregation contract.",
    "Historical test labels remain unopened in this implementation and selection round.",
    "This is a same-validation development sensitivity, not a new prospective confirmation."
